WEBVTT

00:20.950 --> 00:22.250
H-Hey...

00:26.040 --> 00:27.960
Those houses will drop on us.

00:28.880 --> 00:31.710
You think one of those houses... is Eren's?

00:32.590 --> 00:34.050
Eren's house...

00:34.340 --> 00:36.710
...is eavesdropping!

00:38.430 --> 00:40.970
Sasha, could you smack Conny?

00:43.020 --> 00:45.180
I don't think he knows our location.

00:45.440 --> 00:46.170
Yeah.

00:46.520 --> 00:51.270
He's making Shiganshina a sea of flames
by scattering burning debris.

00:52.990 --> 00:54.320
That bastard...

00:55.150 --> 00:59.120
This time, you think you
can burn down my city?!

01:01.120 --> 01:04.159
A-Armin! The fire! Your orders?!

01:04.160 --> 01:05.290
Hurry it up!

01:07.210 --> 01:08.709
I can tell.

01:08.710 --> 01:12.630
You're standing there shaking so much,
you can't do a damn thing.

01:16.010 --> 01:18.470
Jean, can you take my place?

01:21.010 --> 01:23.970
I just have no idea.... what to do...

01:24.640 --> 01:28.210
I was wrong reading Bertholdt,
and look where it got us.

01:28.600 --> 01:30.980
Jean! You're better suited for this!

01:35.400 --> 01:37.360
The river! Move to the river!

01:38.160 --> 01:41.060
Everyone aboard Eren! Conserve our gas!

01:46.040 --> 01:46.680
Eren.

01:47.120 --> 01:50.169
At some point, we'll have to
get Bertholdt's attention,

01:50.170 --> 01:51.880
but until then, don't let him see you.

01:53.630 --> 01:54.280
Armin.

01:56.550 --> 01:58.509
I'm all right at reading situations,

01:58.510 --> 02:01.890
but I'm coming up empty
with a plan to get us out of this.

02:02.350 --> 02:04.720
In the end, we're all counting on you.

03:39.990 --> 03:44.990
"Perfect Game"

03:50.410 --> 03:52.369
We're done cleaning up here.

03:52.370 --> 03:55.790
The only small ones left
are the ones way at the front.

03:56.540 --> 03:59.860
Still, how will we take
down the Beast Titan?

04:00.210 --> 04:03.930
He's perfectly content sitting
way over there, not moving an inch.

04:04.130 --> 04:07.010
Yeah, it seems he's a coward.

04:07.470 --> 04:09.870
Not like he's ever had balls to begin with.

04:10.600 --> 04:11.940
You take a break.

04:12.350 --> 04:14.979
We'll mop up the rest of the small ones.

04:14.980 --> 04:15.980
Let's go!

04:15.981 --> 04:17.060
Roger!

04:19.900 --> 04:20.600
Shit...

04:21.190 --> 04:22.810
What was that explosion?

04:23.240 --> 04:24.860
What happened to those guys?

04:25.490 --> 04:27.570
Did Hange and the others avoid it?

04:28.200 --> 04:30.450
I've gotta hurry to that side and...

04:59.320 --> 05:00.380
Hmm...

05:01.280 --> 05:04.180
That one was a little bit high...

05:05.070 --> 05:07.660
Oh, leave it right there.

05:11.660 --> 05:14.410
Well, the first pitch was a warm-up.

05:15.620 --> 05:18.870
I'm going for a perfect game!

05:20.540 --> 05:21.800
Frontal bombardment!

05:22.000 --> 05:23.960
All troops, take cover!

05:24.260 --> 05:25.050
Huh?

05:25.050 --> 05:25.800
What was that?

05:25.880 --> 05:28.870
Shit! You guys!

05:56.460 --> 05:58.789
What the hell was that sound?!

05:58.790 --> 06:00.709
Does the enemy have cannons?!

06:00.710 --> 06:02.620
If so, there's a hundred of 'em!

06:02.960 --> 06:05.460
Calm down! You're scaring the horses!

06:05.760 --> 06:07.270
The Titan's throwing boulders!

06:07.760 --> 06:08.840
Captain Levi!

06:09.180 --> 06:11.760
All of you, retreat to
the wall with the horses!

06:12.930 --> 06:13.890
Roger!

06:15.680 --> 06:18.190
Hurry! Stay outta the line of fire!

06:24.270 --> 06:26.530
Hey, stand up! You wanna die?!

06:28.610 --> 06:29.240
Commander!

06:30.530 --> 06:31.490
How's it looking?

06:31.950 --> 06:33.409
Terrible.

06:33.410 --> 06:36.420
His throws have destroyed
the front line of houses.

06:37.200 --> 06:40.350
If he keeps on throwing,
everything will get leveled.

06:40.830 --> 06:43.000
We won't have anywhere left to hide.

06:43.500 --> 06:46.160
We can't retreat to the
other side of the wall?

06:46.550 --> 06:47.180
No...

06:47.840 --> 06:50.530
The Colossal Titan is
already heading this way.

06:51.220 --> 06:53.710
Spreading fire all along his path.

06:54.850 --> 06:59.700
Supposing we scale the wall to evade
the stones, we'd have to leave the horses.

07:00.560 --> 07:03.620
If we retreat here, there's
no hope for victory.

07:04.230 --> 07:06.189
What happened to Hange's group?

07:06.190 --> 07:07.360
Is Eren all right?

07:08.490 --> 07:09.430
I don't know.

07:09.900 --> 07:12.940
But the majority of them
were caught in that explosion.

07:13.660 --> 07:15.870
We've been dealt a serious blow.

07:17.040 --> 07:18.831
The Beast Titan directed
the small Titans

07:18.856 --> 07:22.274
so our soldiers would
group up in one place.

07:22.920 --> 07:29.469
As such, while engaging the small Titans,
Dirk Squad, Marlene Squad, and Klaus Squad

07:29.470 --> 07:31.760
were all wiped out by the bombardment.

07:32.840 --> 07:36.010
In other words, our remaining forces
this side of the gate...

07:36.720 --> 07:42.240
...consists of you new Scout recruits,
Captain Levi, and...

07:42.690 --> 07:43.590
...me.

07:49.190 --> 07:50.570
We're doomed!

07:50.990 --> 07:54.090
Erwin... Do you have any sort of plan?

07:57.910 --> 07:59.239
Yell at him, Eren!

07:59.240 --> 08:01.910
Don't let Bertholdt get
any closer to the wall!

08:10.920 --> 08:11.800
He noticed!

08:16.050 --> 08:18.640
What?! That bastard's ignoring us!

08:19.060 --> 08:21.979
Hey! What now, Jean?! At this rate...

08:21.980 --> 08:23.180
I know that!

08:23.560 --> 08:26.440
Eren! Go stop his lanky legs!

08:29.860 --> 08:32.610
But still! How the hell
are we gonna defeat him?!

08:33.030 --> 08:37.740
His gusts of hot steam make
our ODM gear useless! Right?!

08:38.830 --> 08:40.380
You don't think I know that?!

08:41.080 --> 08:44.249
But right now, we've got
no choice but to try!

08:44.250 --> 08:46.500
We've gotta figure out his weakness!

08:46.710 --> 08:49.420
I'll do it. You guys distract him.

08:49.840 --> 08:51.759
Conny, your Thunder Spear.

08:51.760 --> 08:53.420
R-Right!

08:53.840 --> 08:56.890
Armin, we need you to
observe him from afar.

08:57.820 --> 08:59.299
So quit your moping.

08:59.300 --> 09:01.500
We gotta believe there's a way to beat him!

09:01.970 --> 09:02.640
Right!

09:05.060 --> 09:06.590
Now! Scatter!

09:09.650 --> 09:11.979
Don't you dare look down on me!

09:11.980 --> 09:13.310
You're nothing more...

09:13.610 --> 09:17.080
...than a big damn wretched oaf!

09:33.880 --> 09:35.220
H-He's shoving him!

09:35.470 --> 09:38.589
Go, Eren! Knock him over!

09:38.590 --> 09:41.310
There has to be some sort of way!

09:45.140 --> 09:46.060
What?

09:56.280 --> 09:57.370
Eren!

10:02.120 --> 10:04.550
Hey... Is that Eren?

10:05.500 --> 10:07.930
He got himself flung on top of the wall?

10:08.750 --> 10:09.750
By him...

10:13.630 --> 10:15.089
Eren's not moving...

10:15.090 --> 10:18.590
He's not dead!
Focus on the monster at hand!

10:19.260 --> 10:21.480
That might have been pushing it too far...

10:22.050 --> 10:24.850
If we run at him without a plan,
that's what happens.

10:25.850 --> 10:26.890
Unless...

10:27.560 --> 10:29.480
Unless we can somehow
turn the tables on him,

10:29.505 --> 10:33.294
this recovery operation,
all of our lives,

10:33.480 --> 10:35.820
and the future of humanity will be doomed!

10:36.740 --> 10:41.240
Having said that, I'm not about to sit
around while we all get slaughtered!

10:41.490 --> 10:43.330
Let's go on the attack!

10:47.750 --> 10:49.829
He doesn't know about Thunder Spears yet!

10:49.830 --> 10:52.220
Conny, Sasha, and I will distract him!

10:52.580 --> 10:54.669
Mikasa will strike in the opening!

10:54.670 --> 10:55.460
Roger!

10:57.090 --> 11:00.129
Hey, moron! I'll poke out your stupid eyes!

11:00.130 --> 11:02.089
You huge idiot!

11:02.090 --> 11:04.140
You massive pervert lord!

11:05.510 --> 11:07.400
This distraction is so obvious...

11:08.060 --> 11:10.280
But if we nail him with a Thunder Spear...!

11:31.620 --> 11:32.680
Guys!

11:33.920 --> 11:35.539
Is it useless?

11:35.540 --> 11:38.460
His hot steam even knocked
away the Thunder Spears!

11:40.590 --> 11:41.430
Conny!

11:41.431 --> 11:44.350
Shit! Breathing it in burned my throat!

11:45.470 --> 11:47.679
Mikasa! You're bleeding!

11:47.680 --> 11:51.479
I'm fine. A bit of shrapnel from
the Thunder Spears got me.

11:51.480 --> 11:52.980
Thought of anything yet?

11:54.020 --> 11:54.480
Huh?

11:55.020 --> 11:57.480
Have any clues for a counterattack?

12:01.610 --> 12:02.530
Not one...

12:38.820 --> 12:41.390
The Beast Titan has a good
guess where we're at.

12:41.780 --> 12:43.690
This place will look like a honeycomb soon.

12:44.910 --> 12:45.660
Erwin.

12:46.450 --> 12:51.430
If you're saying we've got no chance to
counterattack, let's get ready to flee.

12:52.290 --> 12:54.310
Wake Eren sprawled out up there.

12:54.830 --> 12:57.420
Ride him and flee with
as many people as possible.

12:58.040 --> 13:00.040
At least we'll have some survivors.

13:01.880 --> 13:03.920
Hey! The horse got away!

13:04.430 --> 13:05.770
That was your job!

13:06.010 --> 13:08.299
Shut up! Like it matters!

13:08.300 --> 13:09.510
Excuse me?!

13:10.060 --> 13:13.880
Those Scouts were insanely strong
and they died in an instant!

13:14.350 --> 13:16.340
You know as well as I do!

13:16.900 --> 13:19.030
What good is protecting horses...

13:19.650 --> 13:22.630
...when there's nobody
left to ride them home?!

13:27.870 --> 13:30.000
It all made sense at one point...

13:30.700 --> 13:33.369
If humanity just hid behind the walls,

13:33.370 --> 13:36.460
we'd someday get slaughtered
by Titans out of nowhere.

13:37.210 --> 13:40.250
Somebody has to bite the bullet
and risk taking action.

13:41.000 --> 13:43.140
In order for others to not become victims,

13:43.460 --> 13:46.550
we needed people to become
the victims themselves.

13:47.550 --> 13:49.630
Who will be that brave soldier?

13:50.140 --> 13:56.850
When I was asked that, I actually
believed I could be that someone!

13:57.810 --> 13:59.650
But I never thought...

14:00.190 --> 14:02.210
...that being sent to my death...

14:02.900 --> 14:07.020
...would turn out to be so
utterly meaningless in the end!

14:07.720 --> 14:09.150
Now that I think about it,

14:09.490 --> 14:13.260
I bet almost everyone ends up
saying the same thing as me.

14:14.290 --> 14:16.800
Why did I ever think that I'd...

14:17.670 --> 14:19.750
...somehow be different?

14:25.380 --> 14:29.230
What if whoever's left of the recruits
and Hange's group scatter on horses...

14:29.590 --> 14:31.120
...and try to make it home?

14:31.760 --> 14:35.490
By using them as a decoy,
you guys could escape on Eren.

14:36.560 --> 14:39.350
Levi. What would you do?

14:39.940 --> 14:43.110
I'm facing the Beast Titan.
I'll draw him away...

14:43.320 --> 14:44.020
Impossible.

14:44.650 --> 14:46.340
You won't even get close.

14:47.280 --> 14:48.200
Probably not.

14:48.950 --> 14:53.400
But if you and Eren return
home alive, there's still hope.

14:54.160 --> 14:57.290
Isn't that the best we can
ask for at this point?

14:58.500 --> 14:59.830
What a huge defeat...

15:00.710 --> 15:02.040
To be perfectly honest,

15:02.710 --> 15:05.880
I doubt a single one of us
is making it back alive.

15:07.170 --> 15:10.880
Yes, assuming we had no
way to counterattack.

15:14.970 --> 15:15.930
Is there a way?

15:16.810 --> 15:17.440
Yes.

15:18.390 --> 15:20.140
Why didn't you say that sooner?

15:20.730 --> 15:23.100
Why'd you keep your shitty mouth shut?

15:24.110 --> 15:29.610
If the plan goes well, you may be able
to take down the Beast Titan.

15:30.110 --> 15:31.530
But it will take the recruits...

15:32.200 --> 15:33.960
...and myself to give our lives.

15:39.580 --> 15:41.210
It's like you said.

15:41.920 --> 15:44.320
Either way, most of us will die.

15:46.050 --> 15:49.560
No, it's almost guaranteed
we'll all be wiped out.

15:50.840 --> 15:55.970
In which case, we can stake our heroic
deaths on a slim chance of victory.

15:57.770 --> 15:58.890
For this to work...

15:59.480 --> 16:01.510
To ask these young ones to die,

16:02.020 --> 16:05.500
it would take an expert con man
and a whole slew of lies.

16:06.900 --> 16:10.930
If I do not lead the vanguard,
none of them will follow.

16:11.490 --> 16:13.500
And I will die before anyone else.

16:14.370 --> 16:18.490
Without ever learning
what's in the basement...

16:20.040 --> 16:20.780
Huh?

16:28.460 --> 16:29.430
I...

16:30.210 --> 16:32.120
I want to go to the basement.

16:33.550 --> 16:35.160
Everything I've done till now...

16:36.010 --> 16:38.430
...was because I thought
this day would come.

16:39.890 --> 16:43.280
That someday, I could check if I was right.

16:45.190 --> 16:48.950
So many times... I thought death
would be so much easier.

16:49.780 --> 16:54.410
But always, the dream I shared with
my father flashed through my mind.

16:55.070 --> 17:00.170
And now, I'm close enough to the
answers to reach out and grab them.

17:03.120 --> 17:05.250
They're right there...

17:08.540 --> 17:09.560
But, Levi...

17:12.050 --> 17:14.670
Can you see them? Our comrades?

17:18.800 --> 17:20.810
Our comrades are looking at us.

17:21.770 --> 17:24.500
They want to know what became
of the hearts they gave.

17:25.890 --> 17:28.150
Because the fighting isn't over yet.

17:35.570 --> 17:37.730
Is it all just inside my head?

17:38.450 --> 17:40.760
Nothing more than a childish delusion?

17:47.040 --> 17:48.940
You've fought well.

17:49.960 --> 17:52.970
It's all thanks to you
that we've come this far.

17:55.260 --> 17:56.720
I'm making the choice.

17:59.140 --> 18:01.410
Give up on your dream and die.

18:01.810 --> 18:04.180
Lead the recruits straight into hell.

18:05.140 --> 18:08.040
I will take down the Beast Titan.

18:30.330 --> 18:31.750
Charge!

18:36.880 --> 18:41.210
Well, I figured they wouldn't
lie down and die, but...

18:42.010 --> 18:43.680
A suicide charge?

18:44.100 --> 18:47.340
Here I was thinking they
could do better than that...

18:48.310 --> 18:50.360
Now! Fire!

18:54.860 --> 18:55.940
Smoke?

18:56.740 --> 19:00.240
Oh, it's those signal things...

19:00.280 --> 19:02.620
Tsk! It's coming, move!

19:06.830 --> 19:09.140
I'm announcing our final operation!

19:09.580 --> 19:10.870
All troops, line up!

19:13.250 --> 19:15.160
We will be doing a cavalry charge.

19:15.500 --> 19:18.100
Our goal: To rush the Beast Titan.

19:18.550 --> 19:21.680
Of course, we'll be making
ourselves ideal targets.

19:22.640 --> 19:27.469
So we'll wait until he's ready to throw
and fire our smoke signals together.

19:27.470 --> 19:29.990
That should reduce his accuracy somewhat.

19:30.890 --> 19:35.680
While we're acting as a decoy,
Captain Levi will kill the Beast Titan.

19:36.280 --> 19:37.820
That is our plan.

19:38.780 --> 19:39.450
What?

19:40.150 --> 19:42.780
You want me to go after him
with just ODM gear?

19:43.620 --> 19:45.440
He's standing in an empty area.

19:45.870 --> 19:48.130
There's not even a house or tree in sight.

19:48.870 --> 19:49.620
Wrong...

19:51.210 --> 19:54.880
There happens to be a line of
objects at just the right height.

19:56.840 --> 19:58.590
Sneak close using the Titans...

19:59.630 --> 20:01.620
...and assassinate the Beast Titan.

20:09.310 --> 20:10.360
I'm sorry...

20:18.440 --> 20:22.170
Standing and waiting just means
we'll be showered by more boulders.

20:22.700 --> 20:24.450
Get ready on the double!

20:25.820 --> 20:28.020
Are we all... heading...

20:29.120 --> 20:30.250
...to our deaths?

20:31.620 --> 20:32.400
Yes.

20:33.460 --> 20:36.150
If we're gonna die anyways,
you're saying it's better...

20:37.750 --> 20:39.460
...if we die fighting?

20:40.300 --> 20:41.110
Yes.

20:41.800 --> 20:44.889
Wait... If we're gonna die anyways,

20:44.890 --> 20:48.550
no matter how we die,
even if it's disobeying orders,

20:49.060 --> 20:50.720
it all means nothing, right?

20:51.230 --> 20:52.690
You're precisely right.

20:54.310 --> 20:55.900
It's all meaningless.

20:56.310 --> 20:58.450
No matter what dreams or hopes you had...

20:59.980 --> 21:02.730
No matter how blessed
a life you've lived...

21:03.820 --> 21:06.100
It's all the same if
you're shredded by rocks.

21:06.990 --> 21:08.380
Everyone will die someday.

21:10.040 --> 21:12.270
Does that mean life is meaningless?

21:13.410 --> 21:16.440
Was there even any
meaning in our being born?

21:17.960 --> 21:19.990
Would you say that of our fallen comrades?

21:20.630 --> 21:21.940
Their lives...

21:22.750 --> 21:24.210
Were they meaningless?

21:26.140 --> 21:27.230
No, they weren't!

21:27.680 --> 21:30.560
It's us who gives meaning
to our comrade's lives!

21:31.100 --> 21:34.060
The brave fallen! The anguished fallen!

21:34.440 --> 21:38.310
The ones who will remember
them... are us, the living!

21:38.810 --> 21:43.250
We die trusting the living who follow
to find meaning in our lives!

21:44.150 --> 21:49.110
That is the sole method in which we
can rebel against this cruel world!

21:50.240 --> 21:51.830
My soldiers, rage!

21:52.410 --> 21:54.330
My soldiers, scream!

21:54.660 --> 21:57.370
My soldiers, fight!

23:40.480 --> 23:43.149
For friends who gave up their hearts...

23:43.150 --> 23:45.230
For friends who gave up their dreams...

23:45.650 --> 23:49.460
Until everything burns out,
they will continue running...

23:50.110 --> 23:52.190
...inside the chaos and panic.

23:52.920 --> 23:54.570
Next episode: "Hero."

23:54.571 --> 23:56.489
"Hero"
